'''Jack Hammer''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 793
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Jack Hammer
|name2 = Jack Hammer CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Jack Hammer CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Jack serves as a surprisingly powerful crowd-controller against his target traits, being one of the few units with the [[Metal Killer]] ability, this time taking 18% of a Metal enemy's current HP. Not only that, he maintains an almost 100% uptime on his [[Weaken]], and a forward-piercing [[Omni Strike]] that allows him to snipe incoming enemies. Together, these abilities make him a proficient counter against high HP Metals such as [[Sir Metal Seal]], [[Super Metal Hippoe]], and [[Metal Cyclone]], while still allowing him to handle weaker Metal peons effectively.

Against Zombies, however, his performance is less than stellar, as many are able to burrow in between his attack cycles. Jack's damage leaves a lot to be desired—while enough to knockback most Zombies, it is typically never enough to kill them outright. This makes his [[Zombie Killer]] ability situational; he has only the bare necessities to function ''decently'' in mixed stages featuring Zombie and Metal enemies, but never as your dedicated Zombie crowd controller.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Midranger}}

